  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "seed|2960886|15",
      "text": "城外商路上的指引石被增生物覆蓋了一半，有隊伍去清理了",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776531817,
      "expires_at": 1776535417
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960884|25",
      "text": "有人說聽見了低樓層的結構在微微嗡鳴，像建築在呼吸",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776530919,
      "expires_at": 1776534519
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960882|10",
      "text": "打鐵巷最近接了不少單，聽說是採集隊的工具要換新",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776529383,
      "expires_at": 1776532983
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960885|10",
      "text": "打鐵巷最近接了不少單，聽說是採集隊的工具要換新",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776531054,
      "expires_at": 1776534654
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960884|28",
      "text": "凌晨在窗邊能看到遠處地脈的微光隱約在脈動，像心跳一樣",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776530584,
      "expires_at": 1776534184
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960883|8",
      "text": "有人在樓下收購琉璃化的礦石碎片，出手很闊綽",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776529984,
      "expires_at": 1776533584
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960884|6",
      "text": "市集今天來了一批品相很好的玉質木材，攤販搶著進貨",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776530962,
      "expires_at": 1776534562
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960885|27",
      "text": "十六樓的某面牆突然長出了一小片琉璃化的結晶，很漂亮",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776531500,
      "expires_at": 1776535100
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960886|13",
      "text": "聽回來的人講，城外的肉質籐蔓又往路邊多蔓了一些",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776531648,
      "expires_at": 1776535248
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960886|16",
      "text": "採集隊說城外淺層礦脈的礦石開始出現新的玉化紋理",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776531764,
      "expires_at": 1776535364
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960884|11",
      "text": "藥材價格穩著，但品種比上個月少了幾樣",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776530853,
      "expires_at": 1776534453
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960886|1",
      "text": "五樓那戶陽台的根鬚盤得更緊了，看著倒是挺穩的",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1776531720,
      "expires_at": 1776535320
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960884|17",
      "text": "遠處的地脈微光今晚比平常亮一些，淡綠色的",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1776530789,
      "expires_at": 1776534389
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2960886|4",
      "text": "十六樓商區的地面接縫處冒出了細細的礦脈紋路",
      "source": "event_seed",
